ideo, write the title on paper. Review weekly.\n239: \n240: ---\n241: \n242: ## Your Next Action\n243: \n244: **Open `projects/01_banned_weapons/project_brief.md` and start the production checklist.**\n245: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
